If you run with the idea that HKT are just generic generics then ISelectable makes a lot more sense:
```csharp

public interface ISelectable<X => T<X>>
{ 
    T<B> Select<A, B>(T<A> ta, Func<A, B> mapFunc);
}

// This is fine, we said that ISelectable took a type constructor, not a type and MyCollection without a param is a constructor
